<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina to expand two-year Bonte by $500 million.</title>
<headline>Argentina to expand two-year Bonte by $500 million.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's government will expand the size of its $500 million two-year Bonte treasury bond by $500 million at its next auction on Feb 18, Federico Molina, the Economy Ministry's Director of Credit, said Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It is going to have a total $1.0 billion, the very least it needs to have a decent level of liquidity,&quot; Molino told reporters.</p>
<p>The issue which matures in Dec 1998 was originally issued at a cut-off yield of 8.0 percent in December.</p>
<p>Molina was confirming earlier reports of an expansion.</p>
<p>((--Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
</text>
